05E8CD             0008*     ; oscillator API.  This deliberately preserves melody, rhythm, voice count,
05E8CD             0009*     ; looping and source assignments while approximating the unavailable two-
05E8CD             0010*     ; operator FM timbre with the VDP's four native waveforms.
