06F340             0004*     ; The foreground simulation runs at an exact 30 Hz while the original game
06F340             0005*     ; expresses state durations and speeds in 70-Hz tics. One shared 2,2,3 tic
06F340             0006*     ; cadence is exact over three fixed frames. This deliberately retains the
06F340             0007*     ; DOS scheduler's variable-tics semantics, including SpawnNewObj's unusual
06F340             0008*     ; zero-ticcount latch: a timed state seeded with zero thinks forever without
06F340             0009*     ; advancing its animation state.
