06F340             0012*     ; original, actorat reserves the actor's destination tile while x/y may still
06F340             0013*     ; be one tile behind it. T_Path releases that claim around the actor turn,
06F340             0014*     ; moves toward the cached center, follows plane-1 arrows, and then reclaims
06F340             0015*     ; the newest destination.
