070F54             0001*     ; =============================================================================
070F54             0002*     ; Interactive player motion for the Wolf3D render fixture.
070F54             0003*     ;
070F54             0004*     ; Simulation advances in exact four-tick quanta from MOS's 120 Hz clock:
070F54             0005*     ; 30 fixed updates per second. Rendering is capped by those same quanta and
070F54             0006*     ; remains callback-gated to one frame in flight. If rendering falls behind,
070F54             0007*     ; simulation catches up before the next pose snapshot is submitted.
070F54             0008*     ;
070F54             0009*     ; Controls:
070F54             0010*     ;   W/S         forward/backward
070F54             0011*     ;   A/D         strafe left/right
070F54             0012*     ;   Left/Right  turn left/right
070F54             0013*     ;   Up Arrow    operate the adjacent door (rising edge)
070F54             0014*     ;   Space       attack/fire
070F54             0015*     ;   1/2/3/4     knife/pistol/submachine gun/gatling gun
070F54             0016*     ;   Escape      in-game control panel
070F54             0017*     ;   F1..F10     original direct panel/quick actions
070F54             0018*     ;
070F54             0019*     ; Player collision follows Wolf3D's square PLAYERSIZE AABB and ClipMove
070F54             0020*     ; ordering: combined X/Y, then X only, then Y only. Unlike the DOS tile-wide
070F54             0021*     ; door test, doors collide with the same moving center-plane slab rendered by
070F54             0022*     ; this port's VDP; this lets the player enter either door well. The original
070F54             0023*     ; statinfo[] blocking decorations are represented by a separate 64x64 bitset.
070F54             0024*     ; The eZ80 owns doors, mutable static and pickup state, player inventory, and
070F54             0025*     ; every dirty snapshot sent to the VDP.
070F54             0026*     ; =============================================================================
070F54             0027*     
