073B98             0001**    ; =============================================================================
073B98             0002**    ; Original Episode 1 recorded-demo playback.
073B98             0003**    ;
073B98             0004**    ; Generated assets retain the exact WL1 button/control records.  A record
073B98             0005**    ; owns four original 70-Hz tics.  The 30-Hz simulation advances them with the
073B98             0006**    ; exact rational cadence: add 70 after each fixed step and consume a record
073B98             0007**    ; whenever the accumulator reaches 4*30=120.  Physical input aborts a demo
073B98             0008**    ; back to the control panel and never becomes an application Escape request.
073B98             0009**    ; =============================================================================
